# Built CLI binaries -- `go build ./cmd/<name>` from the repo root, or
# `go build .` from inside the cmd dir itself, drops the binary right next
# to its source instead of into /bin/ above. Ignored by name wherever a dev
# build might land it, not just at the repo root.
